WEBVTT

00:15.000 --> 00:16.360
FRESHMEN INITIATION

00:16.440 --> 00:21.400
[Nanno] Have you ever done something
just because it's what's always been done?

00:22.880 --> 00:24.000
[laughing]

00:24.080 --> 00:28.120
You do it without even knowing
what it is you're preserving.

00:28.200 --> 00:30.600
[brooding music playing]

00:30.680 --> 00:33.200
[Nanno] Many people call it tradition,

00:33.280 --> 00:35.880
which is often deemed as noble.

00:37.120 --> 00:38.080
[thuds]

00:39.000 --> 00:40.160
But is it really?

00:42.320 --> 00:45.040
[theme music playing]

02:10.080 --> 02:10.960
FRESHMEN INITIATION

02:11.040 --> 02:11.920
[clapping, cheering]

02:12.000 --> 02:15.200
[senior student 1] Good job, everyone.
You may all sit down. Sit down, please.

02:15.280 --> 02:16.240
[senior student 2] Whoo!

02:17.040 --> 02:18.200
[K] Hello, everyone.

02:19.040 --> 02:20.280
My name is K.

02:20.360 --> 02:23.840
The student activity president,
and I'm also in charge of organizing

02:23.920 --> 02:25.360
this year's initiation ceremony.

02:25.440 --> 02:26.320
[inhales]

02:26.400 --> 02:27.960
As you all know,

02:28.040 --> 02:31.400
our school's initiation ceremony
is an old and noble tradition

02:31.480 --> 02:33.840
that has been passed on
throughout the years

02:33.920 --> 02:37.560
from my father's generation
to my generation.

02:37.640 --> 02:41.360
It is now our great pride and joy
to pass this tradition on

02:41.440 --> 02:43.320
to all of you freshmen.

02:43.800 --> 02:47.680
So, I'd like to officially welcome you
to this year's initiation ceremony.

02:47.760 --> 02:51.200
[applause]

02:52.000 --> 02:53.040
Are you all hungry?

02:53.120 --> 02:54.440
[freshmen] Yes.

02:54.520 --> 02:56.760
-[K] Are you hungry?
-[freshmen] Yes, we are!

02:56.840 --> 03:00.200
Okay, then. I want you
to get into a group of four

03:00.280 --> 03:02.160
and then turn to face each other.

03:09.600 --> 03:10.720
Here you go.

03:12.000 --> 03:13.200
Take it off.

03:14.160 --> 03:15.920
[sudden music sting]

03:16.920 --> 03:19.080
-[K chuckles]
-[senior 1] Go ahead and eat.

03:19.160 --> 03:21.400
Aren't you all hungry?
What are you waiting for?

03:22.560 --> 03:23.680
[senior 1] Dig in.

03:25.560 --> 03:27.120
-[senior 2] Eat it!
-[senior 1] Closer.

03:27.200 --> 03:28.840
-[senior 2] There.
-[senior 1] Have a bite.

03:28.920 --> 03:29.960
[senior 1] Hurry up!

03:30.040 --> 03:31.080
[senior 2] Good.

03:31.720 --> 03:34.080
-[retching]
-[senior 1] Shit, he's throwing up!

03:34.160 --> 03:37.240
-[seniors booing, laughing]
-Awesome.

03:38.840 --> 03:39.960
[senior 1] Dumbass.

03:40.760 --> 03:43.840
[rattling]

03:56.200 --> 03:58.560
Does anyone know the motto here?

03:58.640 --> 04:03.880
[freshmen] "Commit to excellence
in education, unity and camaraderie."

04:04.600 --> 04:08.280
No, that's not it.
I think that's the school's motto.

04:09.120 --> 04:11.800
Here's our motto. Listen up.

04:12.640 --> 04:14.240
"Whenever a senior

04:15.040 --> 04:16.440
orders you to do something…

04:18.880 --> 04:22.280
don't ask why."

04:22.360 --> 04:24.360
[tense music playing]

04:24.440 --> 04:26.480
You all must do exactly
what the seniors say.

04:28.280 --> 04:29.280
[K] Okay.

04:32.600 --> 04:33.560
Roll it out.

04:35.560 --> 04:37.840
This song is very easy to learn and…

04:38.640 --> 04:41.640
I want all of you to dance along as well.

04:41.720 --> 04:43.560
We'll give you a demonstration.

04:43.640 --> 04:44.720
Ready…

04:44.800 --> 04:46.480
set… go!

04:46.560 --> 04:49.720
♪ One time when I was raped
They made me spread my legs ♪

04:49.800 --> 04:52.040
♪ Oh yes, they did
Oh yes, they did ♪

04:52.120 --> 04:54.280
♪ Shut my eyes, shut my eyes
First time ♪

04:54.360 --> 04:57.000
♪ And they pounded me
Underneath the bridge ♪

04:57.080 --> 04:59.440
♪ Now the cute boys
They were lots and lots ♪

04:59.520 --> 05:01.680
♪ Yeah, yeah, yeah
Oh, yeah, yeah, yeah ♪

05:02.560 --> 05:03.600
[senior] Whoo!

05:04.680 --> 05:06.280
Easy, right? Okay.

05:06.960 --> 05:09.080
Shall we give it a try? Let's do it.

05:09.720 --> 05:11.480
-[K] Get up.
-[senior 1] Stand up.

05:11.560 --> 05:14.040
-[senior 2] Get up.
-[senior 1] Come on. Move it.

05:14.680 --> 05:15.960
I don't…

05:16.040 --> 05:17.800
don't know how to dance like that.

05:19.800 --> 05:20.640
[scoffs]

05:21.680 --> 05:24.440
[K] All right, sit down.
Everyone, sit back down.

05:29.360 --> 05:30.360
Okay.

05:32.040 --> 05:34.000
Okay, if that song is too hard for you,

05:34.080 --> 05:36.560
we'll move on to another activity
which I know you can handle.

05:38.000 --> 05:39.160
TEAM BUILDING ACTIVITY

05:39.240 --> 05:40.800
STEP ONE, TWO, THREE

05:42.720 --> 05:46.200
Our great school takes a lot of pride
in this initiation rite.

05:47.360 --> 05:48.920
The human centipede.

05:50.240 --> 05:53.760
The rule is very simple.
You must go down on all fours

05:53.840 --> 05:57.640
and press your head against the butt
of the person in front of you.

05:57.720 --> 05:59.840
[K] Then, that person
will press their head

05:59.920 --> 06:03.880
against the butt of the person in front
of them and it goes on and on and on.

06:03.960 --> 06:05.600
[snickers]

06:05.680 --> 06:07.840
This will foster unity and solidarity
among all of you.

06:07.920 --> 06:10.920
[laughing maniacally]

06:15.360 --> 06:19.640
How come your idea of unity
seems so sick and disgusting?

06:20.640 --> 06:23.240
It looks more like
sexual harassment to me.

06:32.640 --> 06:35.680
Does anyone else agree
with this Nanno girl here?

06:36.280 --> 06:37.720
[K] If so, raise your hand.

06:42.080 --> 06:43.440
Hm? [scoffs]

06:44.440 --> 06:45.760
Looks like no one agrees with you.

06:47.280 --> 06:48.560
I also agree with Nanno.

06:57.040 --> 06:58.920
[eerie music playing]

07:08.360 --> 07:11.440
[theme music playing]

07:18.360 --> 07:19.520
[muffled screaming]

07:21.600 --> 07:23.040
[screaming]

07:35.160 --> 07:36.840
So, we meet again, Nanno.

07:39.920 --> 07:41.160
So, it's you, Yuri.

07:41.240 --> 07:45.240
Thank you for bringing me back to life,
I really appreciate it.

07:46.040 --> 07:49.280
I'll be learning the ropes from you
in the meantime, if you don't mind.

07:50.640 --> 07:53.200
There's still so much I want to learn
from a girl like you.

07:53.280 --> 07:55.280
[theme music continues]

08:08.200 --> 08:09.640
[music stops]

08:12.240 --> 08:15.120
Okay. Whatever.
You two can keep each other company.

08:15.640 --> 08:17.560
Let me tell you right now

08:17.640 --> 08:20.840
that there's never been any incidents
of sexual harassment here.

08:21.320 --> 08:23.440
[K] We all adhere to the seniority system.

08:23.520 --> 08:25.680
So, when freshmen refuse to follow orders,

08:26.280 --> 08:28.760
it's only fair that they get punished,
am I right?

08:29.520 --> 08:30.840
So, next…

08:33.440 --> 08:34.720
your top comes off.

08:38.200 --> 08:39.600
Take…

08:39.680 --> 08:41.320
it off…

08:41.400 --> 08:42.240
now!

08:42.840 --> 08:45.640
[suspenseful music playing]

08:55.720 --> 08:57.000
You too.

09:09.560 --> 09:10.880
[K sighs]

09:11.480 --> 09:12.520
Good.

09:12.600 --> 09:13.680
Okay.

09:15.160 --> 09:16.920
How about everyone here joins the fun?

09:17.480 --> 09:19.120
Shall we? Come on.

09:19.640 --> 09:22.000
-[K] Everyone get up. Stand up.
-[senior 1] Get up.

09:22.080 --> 09:24.920
-[K] Take off your shirt. Hurry up.
-[senior 2] Move it. Get on with it.

09:26.320 --> 09:29.080
-Take it off!
-[senior 1] Take it off now.

09:31.200 --> 09:32.160
[K] Well, well.

09:33.360 --> 09:34.640
[snickers]

09:34.720 --> 09:37.720
Okay. Look at the camera, everybody.

09:37.800 --> 09:40.120
Look at the camera! Come on.

09:40.200 --> 09:41.840
One, two…

09:41.920 --> 09:43.040
[clicks]

09:43.120 --> 09:44.760
[K] Get home safe, guys.

09:44.840 --> 09:46.360
-See you.
-[K] Okay.

09:49.760 --> 09:52.760
[principal] Hey, there. Good evening.

09:54.560 --> 09:55.440
Hello.

09:55.520 --> 09:56.560
Come here.

10:03.960 --> 10:05.600
[principal] What the hell is this?

10:06.240 --> 10:08.320
[K] Can people in the front move faster?

10:09.800 --> 10:11.400
Keep your head down.

10:11.480 --> 10:14.000
Just follow your friends. Good.

10:14.080 --> 10:15.480
Keep your head down.

10:15.560 --> 10:17.280
[senior] Now, turn around. Circle back.

10:17.360 --> 10:18.200
[K] Turn back.

10:19.480 --> 10:22.880
[senior] Circle back.
Pick up the pace. Turn around.

10:22.960 --> 10:25.600
You'll have to do it again
if the line breaks.

10:26.960 --> 10:29.480
They were being stubborn, so I had to get…

10:30.480 --> 10:31.840
you know, a little rough with them.

10:31.920 --> 10:35.200
Look, I don't really have a problem
with you punishing the kids like that.

10:35.800 --> 10:37.600
[principal] But if this clip gets out,

10:37.680 --> 10:40.200
the school will have
to take responsibility.

10:41.440 --> 10:44.080
You can't let this kind of thing
happen again, understand?

10:45.320 --> 10:46.880
Understand, K?

10:49.840 --> 10:51.400
[K] Have your arms gone limp?

10:52.120 --> 10:53.200
[senior 1] Move it.

10:55.400 --> 10:56.240
Move it.

11:03.360 --> 11:04.880
[Nanno] Good morning, Yuri.

11:09.520 --> 11:10.840
Hey there, Nanno.

11:16.240 --> 11:18.000
You're upset I leaked the video?

11:19.280 --> 11:20.880
Yuri, what is it you want?

11:21.360 --> 11:23.360
I said I wanted to learn from you.

11:23.440 --> 11:25.440
Is there something the matter with that?

11:26.280 --> 11:29.160
Are you afraid that I'll do
a better job than you?

11:29.840 --> 11:31.680
You can do what you like.

11:33.160 --> 11:37.520
But you know what happens
when you hang around me, don't you?

11:44.480 --> 11:45.440
[K] Yesterday…

11:47.320 --> 11:49.240
a certain student posted a clip

11:49.920 --> 11:52.200
of our initiation ritual on the internet.

11:52.880 --> 11:54.160
But don't worry.

11:54.240 --> 11:57.600
Our goal today isn't to find out
who the culprit is here.

11:58.560 --> 12:00.640
But we're going to show you

12:00.720 --> 12:02.440
that our unity can't be shattered.

12:03.080 --> 12:04.920
We are way stronger than that.

12:06.200 --> 12:10.160
First things first, we're going to collect
all of your phones now.

12:12.160 --> 12:14.360
-[senior 1] Your phone, please.
-[senior 2] Give it to me.

12:14.440 --> 12:16.000
[senior 1] Give me your phone. Hurry up.

12:16.080 --> 12:17.480
Your phone, come on.

12:18.240 --> 12:22.240
[phones chiming]

12:22.320 --> 12:23.320
[young K] Why are you…

12:23.400 --> 12:25.640
You have no right to do this.
[panting]

12:25.720 --> 12:29.520
[senior] What? I have no right?
What did you just say to me?

12:29.600 --> 12:31.400
[young K]
I'll tell the press and tell my dad.

12:31.480 --> 12:34.320
I'll tell the professors what you did.

12:34.400 --> 12:36.520
[senior]
Are you going to tell your daddy on us?

12:36.600 --> 12:38.760
-Are you going to tell your daddy?
-[groans]

12:38.840 --> 12:40.480
[senior] Will you tell on us, huh?

12:41.360 --> 12:43.160
How about your mommy?
Is that what you want?

12:43.240 --> 12:44.280
[laughter]

12:44.360 --> 12:47.040
You want me to call your…
Want me to call your momma?

12:47.120 --> 12:49.200
How about a blankie?
Do you need a blankie?

12:49.280 --> 12:52.560
Hey, K. [laughs]

12:53.360 --> 12:54.720
I'm sorry, man.

12:56.480 --> 12:59.560
[ominous music playing]

13:05.240 --> 13:06.640
Did you do this, Nanno?

13:08.920 --> 13:12.280
I just wanted to share
an interesting video with everyone.

13:13.200 --> 13:17.920
You were once a junior student who yelled
at the seniors for going too far.

13:18.600 --> 13:22.800
But now, you've become the senior
who's taking it too far.

13:24.200 --> 13:27.400
[Nanno] What changed?
Why do you need to do this?

13:28.000 --> 13:31.240
Do you want to teach us unity

13:31.320 --> 13:34.080
or is this just your revenge?

13:41.240 --> 13:43.200
[laughs]

13:45.400 --> 13:47.880
Everyone here knows it's for…

13:49.080 --> 13:50.320
unity.

13:50.880 --> 13:52.400
It's for unity.

13:53.280 --> 13:54.720
It's unity!

13:56.880 --> 13:59.920
It means you must
take responsibility together.

14:00.000 --> 14:02.080
So, if someone does something wrong,

14:02.160 --> 14:04.600
you all take responsibility for it, right?

14:05.680 --> 14:06.840
[senior 1] Answer him.

14:06.920 --> 14:07.920
[senior 2] Speak up.

14:08.480 --> 14:09.400
That's all right.

14:10.520 --> 14:12.160
Everyone here except for Nanno,

14:13.200 --> 14:14.080
lie down.

14:14.680 --> 14:17.080
-Lie down. Come on.
-[senior 1] Are you stalling?

14:17.160 --> 14:19.440
-Move it!
-[senior 1] Lie down. Move your asses.

14:19.520 --> 14:20.800
[K] Lie on your back.

14:20.880 --> 14:21.720
Roll.

14:21.800 --> 14:23.400
[senior 1] Move it! Roll over.

14:23.480 --> 14:27.520
[freshmen singing]
♪ Should auld acquaintance be forgot ♪

14:27.600 --> 14:31.240
♪ And never brought to mind? ♪

14:31.320 --> 14:35.920
♪ Should auld acquaintance be forgot ♪

14:36.000 --> 14:39.560
-♪ And days of auld lang syne? ♪
-[senior 1] Sing it loudly!

14:39.640 --> 14:41.120
-[K claps]
-[panting]

14:43.600 --> 14:45.120
Do you all want to go home?

14:48.880 --> 14:50.600
Well, you can't leave quite yet.

14:51.240 --> 14:52.840
The penalty for breaking unity--

14:52.920 --> 14:57.440
K, sorry, but can you talk a bit faster?

14:57.520 --> 14:59.120
I'm about to fall asleep.

14:59.200 --> 15:02.000
[yawns]

15:02.080 --> 15:03.080
All right.

15:03.600 --> 15:05.600
Since you asked, here's your wish.

15:06.280 --> 15:08.040
How about we play one last game?

15:08.680 --> 15:12.480
And after that, you can all go home, okay?

15:12.560 --> 15:15.240
[ominous music playing]

15:19.200 --> 15:22.800
This game will end
when all of your balloons get popped.

15:22.880 --> 15:24.920
[laughing]

15:25.000 --> 15:26.040
When are we going to start?

15:27.440 --> 15:28.760
[clangs]

15:28.840 --> 15:31.440
[K] One, two, three.

15:31.520 --> 15:32.480
[pops]

15:32.560 --> 15:34.160
[laughing]

15:34.240 --> 15:36.120
[K] You're up next. Step forward.

15:37.600 --> 15:39.320
-Do it!
-[Nanno continues laughing]

15:39.400 --> 15:40.360
[clangs]

15:40.440 --> 15:41.800
You're up!

15:41.880 --> 15:44.760
[K] Three, two, one. Strike!

15:45.920 --> 15:47.360
-[laughing]
-[K] Do it again!

15:48.760 --> 15:50.480
-Come closer!
-[clangs]

15:50.560 --> 15:51.960
-Strike!
-[Nanno continues laughing]

15:52.040 --> 15:53.520
-Strike!
-[balloon pops]

15:53.600 --> 15:56.000
-[Nanno continues laughing]
-What the fuck are you laughing at?

15:56.560 --> 15:58.920
[K] Shut up! Shut the fuck up!

15:59.000 --> 16:01.640
[muffled laughing]

16:03.200 --> 16:04.480
-[grunts]
-[laughing]

16:06.440 --> 16:09.200
-Are you gonna stop? Stop right now!
-[laughing maniacally]

16:10.400 --> 16:11.240
[thuds]

16:11.320 --> 16:13.680
[screaming]

16:14.440 --> 16:17.160
[baseball bat clanging]

16:18.680 --> 16:20.960
[tense music playing]

16:28.560 --> 16:30.400
[screaming]

16:33.600 --> 16:34.680
[K screaming]

16:34.760 --> 16:37.800
NANNO

16:42.920 --> 16:45.840
GYM

17:01.040 --> 17:03.920
[approaching footsteps]

17:04.000 --> 17:04.920
[K sniffles]

17:09.680 --> 17:11.920
You went way too far this time, K.

17:16.800 --> 17:18.480
Please don't let me go.

17:19.240 --> 17:21.080
No other school will accept me.

17:21.160 --> 17:24.320
[principal] This is only because
your dad and I are old friends.

17:24.960 --> 17:26.880
I'll cover up this scandal.

17:27.680 --> 17:30.160
But you must leave this school
immediately.

17:31.120 --> 17:32.600
Do you understand?

17:34.600 --> 17:37.560
[somber music playing]

17:44.720 --> 17:46.840
[sobbing softly]

17:57.520 --> 18:00.080
THREE MONTHS LATER

18:00.160 --> 18:03.880
[senior 1] Students in the next row
can step forward and join the line.

18:03.960 --> 18:06.240
-Thank you so much.
-[senior 2] Drop by the campus anytime.

18:06.320 --> 18:07.960
-Hello.
-[senior 1] Keep the line moving.

18:08.040 --> 18:09.560
See you around. If you have questions

18:09.640 --> 18:13.280
about your study or whatever,
feel free to come talk to us seniors.

18:13.360 --> 18:14.960
It's nice to meet you.

18:15.040 --> 18:17.120
-[senior 1] Good luck.
-Thank you so much.

18:17.680 --> 18:19.000
-Hello.
-Hey.

18:21.760 --> 18:23.800
…looks so rad.

18:23.880 --> 18:25.400
[senior 2] You're really cute.

18:26.360 --> 18:28.000
Come talk to us anytime.

18:28.080 --> 18:31.320
-We don't bite.
-[junior] Okay. Thank you.

18:31.400 --> 18:34.320
[senior 2] Thank you. Next one, please.

18:35.800 --> 18:38.440
[Nanno]
If a senior orders you to do something…

18:39.400 --> 18:42.680
don't ask why.

18:45.000 --> 18:47.000
[eerie music]

18:48.040 --> 18:49.560
So nice to meet you.

18:51.480 --> 18:54.000
So, you're K? I'm Nanno.

18:54.640 --> 18:58.320
I'm also a new student here,
but I'm a senior.

18:58.400 --> 18:59.240
[chuckles]

19:00.720 --> 19:01.720
But you're dead.

19:01.800 --> 19:03.480
My name is Nanno.

19:04.680 --> 19:09.120
So, as far as being dead,
I don't think that's exactly the case.

19:10.400 --> 19:11.960
All I know is that…

19:14.000 --> 19:17.920
you're going to experience
so much unity here

19:18.880 --> 19:21.080
at our school. It'll be fun.

19:25.200 --> 19:26.240
[yelps]

19:29.360 --> 19:30.600
K, don't.

19:31.080 --> 19:35.040
It's not very nice to grab a girl's butt,
especially a senior's.

19:36.400 --> 19:37.480
[female senior] Hey.

19:38.920 --> 19:39.920
I didn't touch you.

19:41.880 --> 19:45.480
You didn't, huh?
Are you calling me a liar, K?

19:46.120 --> 19:48.800
[male senior] She's a senior.
You call her a liar?

19:48.880 --> 19:51.000
-Grab him.
-Hey.

19:51.080 --> 19:53.840
-[female senior] Admit to it.
-[male senior] Just admit you did it.

19:53.920 --> 19:55.640
She sat facing me.
How could I grab her butt?

19:55.720 --> 19:57.280
-Stay still.
-Do you like getting handsy?

19:57.360 --> 19:58.880
-Teach him.
-Let me get my hands on you.

19:58.960 --> 20:00.320
[groans]

20:00.400 --> 20:02.640
Whoever gets K to confess

20:02.720 --> 20:04.320
will win a prize from me.

20:05.240 --> 20:09.120
Is Nanno giving us a prize?
Well, then. You better confess.

20:09.200 --> 20:11.240
-Admit you did it. Just come clean.
-[groans]

20:11.320 --> 20:12.560
[female senior] Let's go.

20:12.640 --> 20:13.640
[intense music plays]

20:13.720 --> 20:15.480
[male senior] Will you confess now?

20:15.560 --> 20:17.320
-Come on, admit it.
-Pin him down, come on.

20:17.400 --> 20:19.200
All right, grab him. Come on.

20:19.280 --> 20:20.240
Put him down.

20:20.320 --> 20:22.400
-I told you to stay still!
-[female senior] Hold still.

20:22.480 --> 20:25.640
-Stay still! Just admit to it!
-[seniors clamoring]

20:26.280 --> 20:29.240
This is your last chance. Admit it.

